    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fun physics sandbox game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place traps, saws, spikes, and all sorts of weird obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit gives you coins, which you can use to unlock even more stuff. You can build whatever you want: from simple jump pads to complete obstacle courses full of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can just mess around or try to break your own record, it's all about experimenting and having fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build insane setups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock crazy stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain = Gain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit pays off</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fun physics sandbox game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place traps, saws, spikes, and all sorts of weird obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit gives you coins, which you can use to unlock even more stuff. You can build whatever you want: from simple jump pads to complete obstacle courses full of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can just mess around or try to break your own record, it's all about experimenting and having fun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build insane setups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock crazy stuff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain = Gain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hit pays off</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "A ragdoll sandbox physics game where you place traps, cause pain, and earn coins for every hit. The more it hurts, the more you get.",
